notes:
One related kill chain on csoh.org, and the page's related defense topics.

At stage 03 the page reads ToolShell alongside Storm-0558, with the shared lesson that theft of signing material converts a bounded intrusion into indefinite trusted access. Its inventory defense says the Storm-0558 chain makes the same argument from the cloud side.

The four defense topics the page links are vulnerability management, network security, detection engineering and incident response. The emergency patch path defense also points to the vulnerability management page.
